    "",
    "Good morning, how are you doing?",
    "im good, how are you?",
    "I am doing well. Have you been to the movies lately?",
    "I have! I just went over the weekend, but we love going to the movies and are always looking for recommendations of what looks good?",
    "Me too, love the movies. Have you seen Queen and Slim? It is amazing and gritty. I highly recommend it.",
    "No, ive actually never even heard of it. What genre is it?",
    "It is a drama. What was the movie you saw over the weekend?",
    "I took my daughter to see Frozen 2 with my husband.",
    "Cool, I was thinking of seeing that myself. How was it?",
    "It was better than we could have expected, I think i even like it more than the first. Definitely cant wait until we can buy it.",
    "That;s good. Was there anything that you did not like? What types of movies do you typically like?",
    "I cant really think of anything that didnt exceed my expectations honestly. I normally like romance of comedy movies though.",
    "Cool, that is great about frozen. If you like romance have you seen Last Christmas?",
    "No, but i love Christmas movies!",
    "It's a romance/comedy movie I've hear its quite good. It stars Emilia Clarke from Game of Thrones",
    "We watched the game of thrones series religiously so i love her! Id love to watch that for sure.",
    "Yes I loved that show too. I think she was also in a Star Wars movie. Are you excited for the newest Star Wars to come out at Christmas?",
    "not really my husband is, hes planning on seeing it the day it comes out. Is last christmas out already?",
    "Yes, it came out recently, November 8",
    "Perfect, thats the movie ill be watching later today!"
